{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1088402-benifits-and-drawbacks-of-creating-multiple-offspring","id":1088402,"title":"Benifits and drawbacks of creating multiple offspring","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-05T11:59:13-07:00","id":1088402,"title":"Benifits and drawbacks of creating multiple offspring","content":"Way I see it, the only reason to only create 1 Promethean on your pilgrimage, is guilt.<br /> <br /> not wanting to inflict the horror that is existence as a promethean on more individuals then needed to relace oneself...<br /> <br /> any other reason?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T15:32:00-07:00","id":1088520,"title":"","content":"Each attempt at creating children requires you to acquire corpses, finding raw materials may take a long time if you have specific requirements (such as a flawlessly beautiful corpse or someone who died in a specific way) or require you to carry a half-dozen corpses around while you look for one with a good brain to complete your Frankenstein. If you're finding these corpses, you may have to deal with hostile attention from ghosts, Sin-Eaters, and a wide variety of entirely mundane people who don't appreciate people corpse stealing. If you're making these corpses, you will be attracting ten times the hostile attention.<br /> <br /> Once you have your material, you will still have to go through the ritual, which may create Pandorans (who will try to eat you) or create a firestorm (which will destroy your stuff and attract investigation).<br /> <br /> Don't forget that guilt can be a very strong motivator especially when you have first hand experience of the suffering that you're inflicting on others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13248-jsnider3","name":"jsnider3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-06T16:45:27-07:00","id":1088902,"title":"","content":"Father Mazda (a 1e Osiran) is obsessed with the generative ritual. One would presume he's quite the brood of 'offspring', both Pandoran <i>and</i> Promethean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T12:28:28-07:00","id":1089314,"title":"","content":"Even if you don't care about the suffering you're inflicting on your &quot;child&quot;, <i>they</i> will- even if everything goes well, creating a Promethean carries a high risk of literally making your own worst enemy, especially if you make enough that you start to neglect them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12109-urbenmyth","name":"Urbenmyth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"166"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}